# 統一換行符。容器裡的 shell 腳本一旦帶 CRLF，shebang 會變成
# "#!/bin/sh\r"，runc 找不到 /bin/sh\r，容器起不來，症狀是
# exec container process (missing dynamic library?) ... No such file or directory，
# 而且會一路重啟到健康檢查超時（本專案 5 分鐘）才被判 FAILED。
# Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 會在檢出時把 LF 換成 CRLF，所以必須在這裡鎖死。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# 二進位素材不參與換行轉換
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
